Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.79,0:00:20.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,Scroll up;1000;1080;40;0,平家物语\N祇园精舍钟声响，诉说世事本无常；\N沙罗双树花失色，胜者转衰如沧桑。\N骄奢淫逸不长久，恰如春夜梦一场；\N强梁霸道终覆灭，好似风中尘土扬。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.09,0:00:22.32,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:23.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（敲门声）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:26.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我买了巧克力碎蜜瓜包
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:35.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.18,0:00:43.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.55,0:00:45.97,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.70,0:00:49.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当不了英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:51.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就此别过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.45,0:01:00.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（门铃声）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.86,0:01:01.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.51,0:01:04.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.92,0:01:05.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.08,0:01:07.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.80,0:01:09.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.69,0:01:14.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们跟我说 你为了解开王国和王妃的诅咒 去了那边的世界...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.10,0:01:18.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 是这样的...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.57,0:01:20.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！是姐姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.95,0:01:24.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴姐姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.80,0:01:25.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿红
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.01,0:01:28.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.88,0:01:31.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回来了 就是说已经打倒坏蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.44,0:01:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经是真正的英雄了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.37,0:01:37.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿红 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.17,0:01:39.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.67,0:01:42.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,土豆炖肉要凉了 快进来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.98,0:01:44.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.63,0:01:45.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（肚子叫了）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.18,0:01:46.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.75,0:01:48.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肚子饿了...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.19,0:01:50.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.20,0:03:29.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}粉碎的梦想与复苏的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.23,0:00:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.59,0:03:32.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊 发生了这种事...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.27,0:03:36.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐的笔为什么会坏掉？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.30,0:03:41.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幻镜笔是从这里诞生出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.40,0:03:46.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是由我的感情化作的实体吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.35,0:03:50.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 现在我失去了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.14,0:03:53.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失去了面对强敌的勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.53,0:03:56.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失去了成为英雄的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.06,0:04:00.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不敢信任朋友们的作战计划
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.66,0:04:02.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我害怕失败
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.52,0:04:07.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以幻镜笔才会坏掉的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.90,0:04:11.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我... 没能成为英雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.95,0:04:14.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.20,0:04:15.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不好！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.80,0:04:19.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是跟我说好的吗 “绝对要成为英雄”的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.54,0:04:21.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么这么轻易就放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.86,0:04:22.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿红
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.95,0:04:24.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.96,0:04:31.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.02,0:04:36.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对别人深思熟虑后做出的选择评头论足 就是错误的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.08,0:04:39.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿红！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.36,0:04:44.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐这个胆小鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.16,0:04:46.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.93,0:04:47.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.02,0:04:52.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃吧 你妈做的炖肉可好吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:54.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不够再添 我做了好多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.87,0:04:57.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.18,0:05:07.00,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真的不去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.69,0:05:12.08,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 还是让她一个静一静比较好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.43,0:05:15.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去打扰她的话 小晴肯定会...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.02,0:05:17.87,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我有不同的观点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.78,0:05:20.53,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,伙伴是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.15,0:05:24.85,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么Precure是4个人 而不是1个人？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.71,0:05:27.08,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.36,0:05:30.05,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么不跟我们谈一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.74,0:05:32.43,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,晴雯丽...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.39,0:05:35.79,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.62,0:05:39.55,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 我们去一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.85,0:05:41.93,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,有我跟着 你放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.11,0:05:44.50,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小白 你别担心 等我们回来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.55,0:05:48.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对要成为英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.31,0:05:57.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心目中理想的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:06:00.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梦想是驱动人前进的源泉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:04.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而当人失去这一梦想之时
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.22,0:06:09.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人又当依靠何物继续前行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.00,0:06:11.05,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.42,0:06:12.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找不到答案
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.35,0:06:19.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纵使我已经读了万卷书 行了万里路
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.53,0:06:23.64,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,请让我们跟晴雯丽谈一谈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.40,0:06:27.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她正好出门了 所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.06,0:06:29.51,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这么晚还出门...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.99,0:06:33.56,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以在这里等她回来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.01,0:06:41.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里好怀念啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.82,0:06:42.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.70,0:06:48.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那一天 我在学校 跟欺负弱小的人吵了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.24,0:06:51.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一个人打不过他们...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.39,0:06:54.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.41,0:06:56.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望我能够成为英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.41,0:06:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望我能够成为英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.36,0:07:01.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望我能够...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.57,0:07:05.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能成吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.58,0:07:09.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不厉害 又害怕吵架
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.15,0:07:12.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且 而且...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.21,0:07:15.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的心是怎么说的？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.95,0:07:19.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.11,0:07:23.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.63,0:07:30.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.28,0:07:34.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望我能够成为英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.51,0:07:38.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望我能够成为英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.71,0:07:40.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望我能够成为英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.78,0:07:42.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望我能够成为英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:44.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望我能够成为英雄!!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.05,0:07:47.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望我能够成为英雄!!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.97,0:07:50.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些流星是爸爸唤来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.27,0:07:54.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是你唤来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.74,0:08:04.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.49,0:08:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.61,0:08:07.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,足够了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:12.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使没有成为英雄 小晴依旧是小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.42,0:08:15.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是个善良率直的好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.99,0:08:18.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你们接纳现在的小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.49,0:08:21.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了 她现在需要一点时间
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.37,0:08:26.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,请帮我们转告小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.91,0:08:29.86,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,“大伙都最喜欢你了”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.42,0:08:32.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定带到 谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.45,0:08:35.19,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼 我们回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.41,0:08:37.38,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.68,0:08:59.23,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,晴雯丽已经变不了Precure了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.65,0:09:02.06,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,要击溃剩下的就简单了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.17,0:09:09.09,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不过... 比起自己受伤 朋友受伤了 她会更痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.35,0:09:14.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴就是这种类型的孩子啊 哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.52,0:09:18.85,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈哈... 啊哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.23,0:00:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.63,0:09:50.22,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙 都过来一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:53.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噼 噼 噼 噼噼...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.29,0:09:54.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噼噼噼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.59,0:09:55.48,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.69,0:09:58.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,上次那个乱暴兽出现在城里了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.45,0:10:00.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.51,0:10:01.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.47,0:10:04.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,快来吧 Precure们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.39,0:10:07.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万事小心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.52,0:10:10.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶 我有事麻烦你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.44,0:10:14.98,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,能帮我... 把这个带给小晴吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.32,0:10:22.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.93,0:10:27.52,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,净化暗塌谷能量 救出飒拉拉队长！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.07,0:10:30.39,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我们上吧 这也是为了晴雯丽！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.33,0:10:32.61,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.23,0:00:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.32,0:10:39.12,CurePri,,0,0,0,,天空幻镜！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.32,0:10:39.12,CurePri,,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Mirage！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.23,0:00:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.59,0:10:42.53,CurePri,,0,0,0,,天籁接通！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.59,0:10:42.53,CurePri,,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Tone Connect！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.23,0:00:00.23,CurePri,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.82,0:10:48.54,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,海阔天空变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.23,0:00:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.58,0:10:51.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,棱镜！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.58,0:10:51.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.23,0:00:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.42,0:10:58.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,辽阔拂远的柔光！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.86,0:11:00.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.86,0:11:00.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}棱镜愈卫！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.23,0:00:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.83,0:11:04.79,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,高阔凌云的勇气！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.99,0:11:07.50,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.99,0:11:07.50,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}飞翼愈卫！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.23,0:00:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.67,0:11:12.84,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,壮阔飞扬的神彩！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.67,0:11:12.84,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1095,970)}Wonderful
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.54,0:11:15.30,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Butterfly！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.54,0:11:15.30,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}蝴蝶愈卫！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.23,0:00:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.90,0:11:22.22,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,真强诶！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.39,0:11:25.32,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,操纵这家伙的我也是强得很！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.82,0:11:29.74,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我教你一句这边世界的谚语
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.79,0:11:34.05,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,猛犬不吠 吠犬不猛！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.52,0:11:36.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼... 汪！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.66,0:11:38.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,拉拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.57,0:11:42.50,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.90,0:11:56.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由由阿姨...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.35,0:11:58.69,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.54,0:12:05.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经不是Precure了...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.03,0:12:07.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.74,0:12:12.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她拜托我给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.99,0:12:15.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.48,0:12:16.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.17,0:12:18.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.14,0:12:21.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.83,0:12:29.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.92,0:12:43.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴你好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.43,0:12:47.47,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.78,0:12:51.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你还记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.51,0:12:54.10,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我第一次变身成Precure的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.26,0:12:56.99,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴是强烈反对的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.49,0:13:00.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你说过 “我不愿意真白同学受伤”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.00,0:13:02.26,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.92,0:13:04.77,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,“只要我变得更强”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.39,0:13:08.56,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,“你就不用战斗了”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.90,0:13:10.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是这么说的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.35,0:13:12.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.87,0:13:17.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这次该我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.99,0:13:22.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能光看着...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.23,0:00:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.32,0:13:35.63,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄气阔！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.12,0:13:37.96,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,蝴蝶扑击！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.12,0:13:37.96,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Butterfly Press！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.23,0:00:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:41.46,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.23,0:00:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.83,0:13:43.86,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄气阔！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.00,0:13:46.21,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,飞翼冲击！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.00,0:13:46.21,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Wing Attack！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.23,0:00:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.53,0:13:48.59,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,拉拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.23,0:13:52.62,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱... 暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.80,0:13:53.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.55,0:13:57.28,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,比之前更强了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.80,0:14:01.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经将暗塌谷能量注入至极限了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.01,0:14:06.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？心碎了吗？啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.41,0:14:07.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呦！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.55,0:14:11.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,还不死心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.66,0:14:17.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,队长就交给我们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.19,0:14:21.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.03,0:14:24.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴不当Precure也没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.35,0:14:26.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,可以不用战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.41,0:14:31.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,在家里好好休息 希望你能打起精神来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.74,0:14:36.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,最后再说一句
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.95,0:14:40.89,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不要说什么“我当不了英雄”
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.79,0:14:45.97,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,因为小晴在很久很久以前
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.74,0:14:49.23,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,就已经是一个英雄了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.38,0:14:57.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不是英雄... 我只是个胆小鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.92,0:14:59.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我害怕战斗 逃跑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.40,0:15:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我抛下了飒拉拉队长 抛下了伙伴\N\N抛下了市民 抛下了所有人！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:09.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这算什么英雄啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.78,0:15:32.39,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.40,0:15:36.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能 会有这种英雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.03,0:15:42.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.61,0:15:46.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须去...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.76,0:15:52.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我还会给你写信的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.90,0:15:54.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.29,0:16:00.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朋友在等我！
Dialogue: 1,0:15:57.29,0:16:00.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}朋友在等我！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.52,0:16:13.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.72,0:16:14.82,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.06,0:16:17.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个... 没有坏吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.36,0:16:21.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.98,0:16:24.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梦想肯定不止一个
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.94,0:16:26.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.23,0:16:29.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使失去了 即使破灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.94,0:16:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还能一次次重生
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.60,0:16:37.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然这是她做出的决定...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.82,0:16:42.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走吧 要笑着送她出发
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:44.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.21,0:16:46.17,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.57,0:16:49.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太帅了 姐姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.12,0:16:51.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 没问题吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.36,0:16:53.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.60,0:16:54.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.27,0:16:58.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你踌躇不前的时候 随时可以回来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.10,0:17:00.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会给你做土豆炖肉的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.86,0:17:01.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.53,0:17:07.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在事态严峻 上次的乱暴兽在城里大闹
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.17,0:17:09.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.05,0:17:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.08,0:17:16.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.18,0:17:20.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.55,0:17:22.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.44,0:17:32.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,“英雄” 不是现在的我 能够随口谈及的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.97,0:17:34.13,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.28,0:17:35.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.52,0:17:40.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 你愿意这么称呼我的话！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.04,0:18:06.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,且看我英雄亮相！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.64,0:18:08.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:10.49,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.68,0:18:12.26,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不... 不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.74,0:18:18.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女·天空拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.74,0:18:18.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Hero Girl Sky Punch！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.34,0:18:20.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.00,0:18:22.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.98,0:18:26.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,即使前行的脚步就要停下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.18,0:18:30.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我的背后 还有推动我前进的人们！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.25,0:18:32.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,所以！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.62,0:18:33.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,所以!!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.75,0:18:38.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,"别停下脚步 英雄少女"！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.28,0:18:40.43,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,拉拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:43.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.04,0:18:52.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.59,0:18:54.72,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,拉拉拉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.03,0:18:56.10,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.58,0:18:57.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.07,0:19:03.67,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,冲啊 小白！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.92,0:19:05.92,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,晴雯丽 战胜自己！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.23,0:00:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
