Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.10,0:19:26.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔镜平板
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.10,0:19:26.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Mirrorpad
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.23,0:00:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.41,0:19:40.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.71,0:19:43.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,治愈的力量 飞扬起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.56,0:19:48.89,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,萨拉拉队长！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.86,0:19:53.97,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了 睁开眼睛！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.11,0:19:56.40,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.56,0:19:57.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不许动！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.08,0:20:01.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你要敢动一丝...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.80,0:20:03.97,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对饶不了你！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.54,0:20:10.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.07,0:20:12.23,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.94,0:20:16.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,只要还有人相信着 盼望着
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.62,0:20:18.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就能够无数次站起来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.47,0:20:22.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这才是英雄啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.72,0:20:27.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...金句良言啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.92,0:20:32.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又见面了 英雄少女
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.77,0:20:40.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,飒拉拉队长... 我好想你...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.17,0:20:45.48,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能 不可理喻 没道理的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.64,0:20:46.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.65,0:20:49.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.04,0:20:51.89,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,虚... 虚蜢蜢！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.78,0:21:02.84,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你... 你们现在不了结我 我还会再来的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.37,0:21:05.96,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我还会来激怒你的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.13,0:21:09.19,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,这样都无所谓吗 晴雯丽！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.89,0:21:12.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.63,0:21:14.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你耍什么花招 我都不会再重蹈覆辙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.72,0:21:17.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我会变得更强的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.56,0:21:27.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 坚强又温柔的孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.28,0:21:31.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你教导出来的吧？由由博士
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.69,0:21:36.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不... 不如说我反而受教了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.06,0:21:39.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我还不成熟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.43,0:21:43.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 既然不成熟那就该继续前进
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.58,0:21:45.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,坚持下去 总会有一天...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.98,0:21:52.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学 阿翼 小蝶姐 还有小空
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.81,0:21:54.28,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.42,0:21:57.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,以后也请多多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.65,0:21:59.66,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.97,0:22:02.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这本手账...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.66,0:22:04.79,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你能再收下一次吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.21,0:22:08.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.88,0:22:16.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对要... 成为英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.23,0:00:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.59,0:22:23.99,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Dream！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.59,0:22:23.99,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1075,970)}梦想愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.74,0:22:28.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,和我一起做快乐的事情吧 决定了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.55,0:24:03.61,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,闪亮药水完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.80,0:24:05.59,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快回蓝天大地吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.85,0:24:07.76,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,这下就能再见到爸爸和妈妈了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.05,0:24:09.00,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.26,0:24:11.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！小空 那光芒是...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.56,0:24:12.64,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.67,0:24:15.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.67,0:24:15.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.22,0:24:18.10,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,闪耀最亮星☆ 小空的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.27,0:01:53.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.48,0:01:59.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:04.62,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.62,0:02:12.33,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.53,0:02:17.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.74,0:02:21.74,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.74,0:02:23.22,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.22,0:02:27.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.10,0:02:32.10,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.19,0:02:34.06,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.19,0:02:38.65,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.03,0:02:42.60,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.60,0:02:45.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.64,0:02:45.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.99,0:02:48.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飞跃而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.39,0:02:48.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(让我们张开勇气之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.35,0:02:53.75,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 朝气蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.96,0:02:58.42,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把烦躁化为光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.65,0:03:03.72,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未来的图景 充满着可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.89,0:03:08.45,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,与在同一片蓝天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.85,0:03:11.27,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起唤起通向明日的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.39,0:03:19.27,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海阔天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
